@startuml
title Personal Developer Context Engine

left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

actor Developer
component "Coding Assistant\nCodex / Claude" as Agent

rectangle "Spring Boot Context Engine" as Engine {
  interface "MCP Endpoint" as MCP
  component "Task Context\nOrchestrator" as Orchestrator
  component "Scope Resolver" as Scope
  component "Context Selector" as Selector
  component "Wiki Navigator" as Wiki
  component "Context Validator" as Validator
  component "Context Update\nManager" as UpdateManager

  MCP --> Orchestrator
  Orchestrator --> Scope
  Orchestrator --> Selector
  Selector --> Wiki
  Orchestrator --> Validator
  Orchestrator --> UpdateManager
}

folder "Repository" as Repository {
  folder "engineering-context/core" as CoreContext
  folder "engineering-context/work" as WorkContext
  file "index.md\ncontext map" as ContextIndex
  folder "Application Code" as Code
  folder "Automated Tests" as Tests
}

database "Git\nbranch, changes, history" as Git
cloud "Enterprise Context Sources\nConfluence, Jira, databases\n(optional extension)" as Enterprise

Developer --> Agent : One implementation task
Agent --> MCP : prepare_task_context(task)

Scope --> Git : Resolve repository, branch\nand active feature
Scope --> WorkContext : Restrict feature scope

Selector --> ContextIndex : Discover available knowledge
Selector --> CoreContext : Select shared context
Selector --> WorkContext : Select feature context
Wiki --> ContextIndex : Follow descriptions and links

MCP --> Agent : Context plan\npaths, reasons, exclusions
Agent --> Repository : Read selected Markdown directly\nexactly once

Agent --> Code : Implement change
Agent --> Tests : Add and run tests

Agent --> MCP : propose_context_updates(change summary)
UpdateManager --> Validator : Validate proposed changes
Validator --> CoreContext : Check structure and consistency
Validator --> WorkContext : Check completeness and freshness
UpdateManager --> Agent : Return reviewable diff
Agent --> Developer : Request approval
Developer --> Agent : Approve context update
Agent --> MCP : apply_context_updates(proposal ID)
UpdateManager --> WorkContext : Write validated Markdown update

Agent --> Git : Commit code, tests and context\nas one focused change

Enterprise ..> Selector : Future ContextSource adapter
Enterprise ..> UpdateManager : Future managed write adapter

note bottom of Engine
  MCP is the control plane.
  It selects, validates and updates context;
  it does not return a duplicate copy of local files.
end note

note bottom of Repository
  Markdown remains the repository-local source of truth.
end note

@enduml
